<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1625_5911.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntlich</unclear> willig dienst, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir
<lb n="2"/>ehren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leibs</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guots</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermügend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, edlen,
<lb n="3"/>vesten, frommen, fürsichtigen, ersammen und
<lb n="4"/>weisen, insonders guoten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freünden</unclear> und ge-
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">treüwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear>.
<lb n="6"/>Wir werdend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtmarsweiß</unclear> berichtet, wie
<lb n="7"/>daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. und E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. mit und nebend
<lb n="8"/>anderen mehr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Orten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">loblicher</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eydtgnoßschafft</orgName>,
<lb n="9"/>bey <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kurtz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verwichnen</unclear> tagen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nutzliche</unclear> und
<lb n="10"/>gar <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> ordnung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestellt</unclear>, von wegen allerley
<lb n="11"/>guldinen und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">silbernen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müntzsorten</unclear>, wie
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ebenmessig</unclear> deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wechßels</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müntzens</unclear>, und
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müntz</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anhangenden</unclear> sachen halber,
<lb n="14"/>wie es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> einer loblichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoß</unclear>-
<lb n="15"/>schafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestendigklich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sölle</unclear> gehalten werden.
<lb n="16"/>Dieweil nun bey unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jnn</unclear> lange zeit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hero</unclear> der
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntzen</unclear> halber allerhand und nit geringer
<lb n="18"/>mangel und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mißbrauch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gespüret</unclear> worden,
<lb n="19"/>unangesehen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> für mitel und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wäg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> wider
<lb n="20"/>solche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unordnungen</unclear> mehrmalen
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angewendt</unclear>, jedoch alles nit helffen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mügen</unclear>.
<lb n="22"/>Solchem übel aber, alß daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">je</unclear> lenger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">je</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ärger</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>wurde, lenger nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuosehen</unclear> könnend. So
<lb n="24"/>sind wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorhabens</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deme</unclear> durch anstellung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoter</unclear>
<lb n="25"/>ordnung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobegegnen</unclear>.
<lb n="26"/>Damit wir aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hierinnen</unclear> nit allein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> desto
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bstendigkeit</unclear> gelangen, sonderen auch mit
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samt</unclear> den übrigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jren</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">neüw</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>angestellter ordnung, sovil alß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jmmer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>sein kan, ein gleichheit treffen, und unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beyden</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1625_5912.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/>in ander mehr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weg</unclear> desto <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besßer</unclear> darnach zuverhalten
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßen</unclear> moegen. So gelangt an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>: und
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">F</unclear>: E: <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>: unser gantz freündtlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eidtgnößisches</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>bitten und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersuochen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> fall es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> zu
<lb n="36"/>wider oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedenckhlich</unclear> fallen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mechte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> bey
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeigern</unclear> diß, allein deßhalb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgesandtem</unclear> botten,
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abschrifften</unclear> der diser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neüwbeschloßnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntz=</unclear>
<lb n="39"/>ordnung <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eidtgnößisch</unclear> zu communicieren, und unß
<lb n="40"/>darbey unbeschwerdt zuberichten, von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welchen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orten</unclear>
<lb n="41"/>diselbige <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angenommen</unclear> worden seye, oder nit.
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Daran</unclear> beschicht unß ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündtlichs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angenemes</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eidtgnößischs</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gfallen</unclear>. Daß umb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">E</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>: und
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">F</unclear>: E: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wt</unclear>: in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dergleichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fälen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">widerumb</unclear> zube=
<lb n="45"/>schulden und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonsten</unclear> alle <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eidtgnößische</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>freündtschafft treüw liebe und guots, bests
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> vermögens zuerweisen, seyen
<lb n="48"/>wir willig und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begirig</unclear>. Unß damit
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">goetlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewarung</unclear> treüwlich
<lb n="50"/>bevelhende. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear>. <origDate when="1608" resp="#ner">10. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>. Octobris <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ao</unclear> 1608</origDate>.
<lb n="51"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und R. d Statt
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></orgName>.
<lb n="53"/>An <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">die von Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1625_5913.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1625_5914.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="54"/>An die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zuerich</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">newen</unclear>
